    "shortInfo": "Board of Secondary Education, Rajasthan (BSER) has officially announced the RBSE Class 10th Result. Students can now check their scores using their Roll Number on the official portal rajeduboard.rajasthan.gov.in. Here is everything you need to know about downloading your digital marksheet and re-evaluation options.",
    "totalVacancies": "",
